d=3D"1834">docs/competitions/QUICKSTART.md</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1836" data-end=3D"1847">Main ideas:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"3063">
<li data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"2114">
<p data-start=3D"1851" data-end=3D"1863"><strong data-start=3D"1851" data-e=
nd=3D"1862">Prereqs</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1866" data-end=3D"2114">
<li data-start=3D"1866" data-end=3D"1879">
<p data-start=3D"1868" data-end=3D"1879">Python 3.8+</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1882" data-end=3D"1918">
<p data-start=3D"1884" data-end=3D"1918">Object storage (R2/S3) credentials=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1921" data-end=3D"1945">
<p data-start=3D"1923" data-end=3D"1945">Registered on subnet 2</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1948" data-end=3D"1971">
<p data-start=3D"1950" data-end=3D"1971">16=E2=80=9332GB RAM, 50GB SSD</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1974" data-end=3D"2114">
<p data-start=3D"1976" data-end=3D"2114">Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3) strongly =
recommended (validators run on macOS arm64; they care about parity between =
your environment and theirs).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2116" data-end=3D"2707">
<p data-start=3D"2118" data-end=3D"2142"><strong data-start=3D"2118" data-e=
nd=3D"2141">High-level workflow</strong>:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"2145" data-end=3D"2707">
<li data-start=3D"2145" data-end=3D"2207">
<p data-start=3D"2148" data-end=3D"2207">You build or adapt a <strong data-=
start=3D"2169" data-end=3D"2178">model</strong> (ONNX or ezkl) for the task=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2210" data-end=3D"2267">
<p data-start=3D"2213" data-end=3D"2267">You build a <strong data-start=3D"=
2225" data-end=3D"2236">circuit</strong> that proves correct inference.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2422">
<p data-start=3D"2273" data-end=3D"2303">You package circuit artifacts:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2422">
<li data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2327">
<p data-start=3D"2311" data-end=3D"2327"><code data-start=3D"2311" data-end=
=3D"2327">model.compiled</code></p>
