<li data-start=3D"2333" data-end=3D"2422">
<p data-start=3D"2335" data-end=3D"2422"><code data-start=3D"2335" data-end=
=3D"2350">settings.json</code> with ezkl/jolt run args (<code data-start=3D=
"2376" data-end=3D"2394">input_visibility</code>, <code data-start=3D"2396"=
 data-end=3D"2415">output_visibility</code>, etc).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2425" data-end=3D"2458">
<p data-start=3D"2428" data-end=3D"2458">You upload to storage (R2/S3).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2461" data-end=3D"2561">
<p data-start=3D"2464" data-end=3D"2561">The <strong data-start=3D"2468" da=
ta-end=3D"2477">miner</strong> advertises the circuit hash/metadata to the =
validator via the competition protocol.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2564" data-end=3D"2707">
<p data-start=3D"2567" data-end=3D"2626">Validators periodically download y=
our circuit and evaluate:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2632" data-end=3D"2707">
<li data-start=3D"2632" data-end=3D"2667">
<p data-start=3D"2634" data-end=3D"2667">Accuracy on hidden benchmark data<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2673" data-end=3D"2685">
<p data-start=3D"2675" data-end=3D"2685">Proof size</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2691" data-end=3D"2707">
<p data-start=3D"2693" data-end=3D"2707">Response time.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2709" data-end=3D"3063">
