<li data-start=3D"2749" data-end=3D"2813">
<p data-start=3D"2751" data-end=3D"2813">Only <code data-start=3D"2756" dat=
a-end=3D"2772">model.compiled</code> + <code data-start=3D"2775" data-end=
=3D"2790">settings.json</code> are strictly required.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2816" data-end=3D"2930">
<p data-start=3D"2818" data-end=3D"2930">Competition end date is 2025-04-27=
 (so this specific run is historically bounded, but the code path is generi=
c).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2933" data-end=3D"3063">
<p data-start=3D"2935" data-end=3D"3063">They emphasize you shouldn=E2=80=
=99t touch the evaluation timeout (they hard-limit proving to <code data-st=
