<p data-start=3D"4196" data-end=3D"4230"><code data-start=3D"4196" data-end=
=3D"4230">neurons/_validator/competitions/</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4232" data-end=3D"4243">Key pieces:</p>
