<h3 data-start=3D"5410" data-end=3D"5444">3.2. Competition worker thread</h=
3>
<p data-start=3D"5446" data-end=3D"5479"><code data-start=3D"5446" data-end=
=3D"5462">competition.py</code> (validator side)</p>
<p data-start=3D"5481" data-end=3D"5537">This is a fairly complex thread cl=
