<ul data-start=3D"5595" data-end=3D"5893">
<li data-start=3D"5595" data-end=3D"5672">
<p data-start=3D"5597" data-end=3D"5672"><code data-start=3D"5597" data-end=
=3D"5610">competition</code> config (id, directories, circuit manager, meta=
graph, config).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5677" data-end=3D"5784">
<p data-start=3D"5679" data-end=3D"5702">Multiprocessing queues:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5709" data-end=3D"5784">
<li data-start=3D"5709" data-end=3D"5743">
<p data-start=3D"5711" data-end=3D"5743"><code data-start=3D"5711" data-end=
=3D"5743">competition_to_validator_queue</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5750" data-end=3D"5784">
<p data-start=3D"5752" data-end=3D"5784"><code data-start=3D"5752" data-end=
=3D"5784">validator_to_competition_queue</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5789" data-end=3D"5845">
<p data-start=3D"5791" data-end=3D"5845">an <code data-start=3D"5794" data-=
end=3D"5803">asyncio</code> event loop reference for async downloads.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5850" data-end=3D"5893">
<p data-start=3D"5852" data-end=3D"5893">a <code data-start=3D"5854" data-e=
nd=3D"5868">bt.subtensor</code> handle to talk to chain.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5896" data-end=3D"6485">
<p data-start=3D"5898" data-end=3D"5908">Main loop:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5913" data-end=3D"6485">
<li data-start=3D"5913" data-end=3D"5954">
<p data-start=3D"5916" data-end=3D"5954">Pop messages from the validator qu=
eue.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5959" data-end=3D"6024">
<p data-start=3D"5962" data-end=3D"6024">For new submissions, look up miner=
 by <code data-start=3D"6000" data-end=3D"6005">uid</code>, get their <code=
 data-start=3D"6017" data-end=3D"6023">axon</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6029" data-end=3D"6118">
<p data-start=3D"6032" data-end=3D"6118">Create a temp directory under <cod=
e data-start=3D"6062" data-end=3D"6095">self.competition.temp_directory</co=
de> keyed by circuit hash.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6123" data-end=3D"6200">
<p data-start=3D"6126" data-end=3D"6200">Use <code data-start=3D"6130" data=
-end=3D"6146">CircuitManager</code> (see below) to download circuit files v=
ia async HTTP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6205" data-end=3D"6353">
<p data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6252">Invoke <code data-start=3D"6215" d=
ata-end=3D"6233">CircuitEvaluator</code> to run evaluation:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6260" data-end=3D"6353">
<li data-start=3D"6260" data-end=3D"6299">
<p data-start=3D"6262" data-end=3D"6299">Run ONNX / ezkl using benchmark da=
ta.</p>
