=3D"6377" data-end=3D"6390">SotaManager</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6396" data-end=3D"6485">
<p data-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6485">Produce updated <code data-start=
=3D"6415" data-end=3D"6428">NeuronState</code> for the miner and push back =
to validator via the queues.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6487" data-end=3D"6640"><code data-start=3D"6487" data-end=
=3D"6500">_get_loop()</code> lazily creates/returns an <code data-start=3D"=
6527" data-end=3D"6536">asyncio</code> loop for downloads. They guard it wi=
th a <code data-start=3D"6578" data-end=3D"6594">threading.Lock</code>, so =
only one loop is ever created per thread.</p>
