=3D"9213">services/circuit_evaluator.py</code></p>
<ul data-start=3D"9215" data-end=3D"10047">
<li data-start=3D"9215" data-end=3D"10047">
<p data-start=3D"9217" data-end=3D"9236"><code data-start=3D"9217" data-end=
=3D"9235">CircuitEvaluator</code>:</p>
