<li data-start=3D"2418" data-end=3D"2535">
<p data-start=3D"2420" data-end=3D"2479">Prefer <strong data-start=3D"2427"=
 data-end=3D"2447">int8 / quantized</strong> or low-bit capable models that=
:</p>
