<p data-start=3D"2586" data-end=3D"2634"><strong data-start=3D"2586" data-e=
nd=3D"2634">Good accuracy with minimal parameters &amp; ops.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<h3 data-start=3D"2636" data-end=3D"2663">Step 2: Distill + prune</h3>
