<ol data-start=3D"2678" data-end=3D"3026">
<li data-start=3D"2678" data-end=3D"2745">
<p data-start=3D"2681" data-end=3D"2745">Train a <strong data-start=3D"2689=
" data-end=3D"2712">large teacher model</strong> (no proof yet) to high acc=
uracy.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2746" data-end=3D"2861">
