<p data-start=3D"6499" data-end=3D"6528">If you want, next step I can:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6530" data-end=3D"6783">
<li data-start=3D"6530" data-end=3D"6620">
<p data-start=3D"6532" data-end=3D"6620">Sketch a <strong data-start=3D"654=
1" data-end=3D"6567">minimal circuit config</strong> + folder structure for=
 your first competition miner.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6621" data-end=3D"6783">
<p data-start=3D"6623" data-end=3D"6783">Or help design the <strong data-st=
art=3D"6642" data-end=3D"6660">tiny CNN / MLP</strong> architecture specifi=
cally tuned for this SN2 task (with concrete layer sizes / parameters) so y=
ou can just start training.</p>
</li>
</ul>
