classification (64=C3=9764 image) is:</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1695" data-end=3D"1753">=E2=AD=90 <strong data-start=3D"1=
700" data-end=3D"1717">TinyAgeNet-v1</strong> (custom, designed for ezkl pr=
oving)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1755" data-end=3D"1778">A specialized tiny CNN:</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1780" data-end=3D"1800"><strong data-start=3D"1784" data-=
end=3D"1800">Architecture</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1801" data-end=3D"1929">
<li data-start=3D"1801" data-end=3D"1824">
<p data-start=3D"1803" data-end=3D"1824">Conv(3=E2=86=9224) stride=3D2</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1825" data-end=3D"1849">
<p data-start=3D"1827" data-end=3D"1849">Conv(24=E2=86=9248) stride=3D2</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1850" data-end=3D"1874">
<p data-start=3D"1852" data-end=3D"1874">Conv(48=E2=86=9296) stride=3D2</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1875" data-end=3D"1901">
<p data-start=3D"1877" data-end=3D"1901">Global average pooling</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1902" data-end=3D"1915">
<p data-start=3D"1904" data-end=3D"1915">FC(96=E2=86=9232)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1916" data-end=3D"1929">
<p data-start=3D"1918" data-end=3D"1929">FC(32=E2=86=9221)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1931" data-end=3D"1955">Why this is perfect:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1957" data-end=3D"2232">
<li data-start=3D"1957" data-end=3D"1981">
<p data-start=3D"1959" data-end=3D"1981">Only ~60k parameters</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1982" data-end=3D"2013">
<p data-start=3D"1984" data-end=3D"2013">Very shallow =3D fast proving</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2014" data-end=3D"2060">
<p data-start=3D"2016" data-end=3D"2060">Uses only <code data-start=3D"2026=
" data-end=3D"2058">Conv =E2=86=92 ReLU =E2=86=92 AvgPool =E2=86=92 Linear<=
/code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2061" data-end=3D"2104">
<p data-start=3D"2063" data-end=3D"2104">No BN (batchnorm is heavy in zk pr=
oofs)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2105" data-end=3D"2143">
<p data-start=3D"2107" data-end=3D"2143">Very good capacity for image tasks=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2144" data-end=3D"2171">
<p data-start=3D"2146" data-end=3D"2171">ezkl compiles it easily</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2232">
<p data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2232">You can apply <strong data-start=
=3D"2188" data-end=3D"2214">knowledge distillation</strong> to boost accura=
cy</p>
</li>
</ul>
