<p data-start=3D"4838" data-end=3D"4859">You may need to tune:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4861" data-end=3D"5022">
<li data-start=3D"4861" data-end=3D"4917">
<p data-start=3D"4863" data-end=3D"4917"><code data-start=3D"4863" data-end=
=3D"4872">logrows</code>: lower =3D faster proving but must fit model</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4918" data-end=3D"4982">
<p data-start=3D"4920" data-end=3D"4982"><code data-start=3D"4920" data-end=
=3D"4933">input_scale</code> / <code data-start=3D"4936" data-end=3D"4949">=
param_scale</code>: lower =3D smaller proof, faster</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4983" data-end=3D"5022">
<p data-start=3D"4985" data-end=3D"5022"><code data-start=3D"4985" data-end=
=3D"4997">commitment</code>: KZG is required for SN2</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5024" data-end=3D"5083">Goal: keep proving time &lt; 60 se=
conds on validator hardware.</p>
