<p data-start=3D"5224" data-end=3D"5302">Start miner =E2=86=92 upload to R2=
/S3 =E2=86=92 validator processes circuit =E2=86=92 you get a score.</p>
<p data-start=3D"5304" data-end=3D"5364">If your circuit beats previous min=
ers =E2=86=92 you become the SOTA.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5366" data-end=3D"5369">
<h1 data-start=3D"5371" data-end=3D"5390">8=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Tuning to win=
</h1>
<p data-start=3D"5392" data-end=3D"5426">To become <strong data-start=3D"54=
02" data-end=3D"5415">top miner</strong>, you want:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5428" data-end=3D"5616">
<li data-start=3D"5428" data-end=3D"5478">
<p data-start=3D"5430" data-end=3D"5478">High accuracy (best teacher =E2=86=
=92 good distillation)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5479" data-end=3D"5512">
<p data-start=3D"5481" data-end=3D"5512">Very small model (fast proving)</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5513" data-end=3D"5557">
<p data-start=3D"5515" data-end=3D"5557">Minimal circuit (logrows &lt; 20 i=
f possible)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5558" data-end=3D"5594">
<p data-start=3D"5560" data-end=3D"5594">Good quantization (int8 preferred)=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5595" data-end=3D"5616">
<p data-start=3D"5597" data-end=3D"5616">Clean ezkl settings</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5618" data-end=3D"5621">
