<li data-start=3D"5694" data-end=3D"5732">
<p data-start=3D"5696" data-end=3D"5732">Dataset loader (UTKFace + IMDB-WIK=
I)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5733" data-end=3D"5753">
<p data-start=3D"5735" data-end=3D"5753">Teacher training</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5754" data-end=3D"5785">
<p data-start=3D"5756" data-end=3D"5785">TinyAgeNet student training</p>
</li>
