<p data-start=3D"741" data-end=3D"815">To <em data-start=3D"744" data-end=
=3D"751">build</em> that circuit for the first time, the team needed a scri=
pt that:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"817" data-end=3D"1114">
<li data-start=3D"817" data-end=3D"850">
<p data-start=3D"820" data-end=3D"850">Loads the default ONNX model</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"851" data-end=3D"880">
<p data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"880">Converts or quantizes it</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"881" data-end=3D"910">
