<p data-start=3D"1116" data-end=3D"1167"><strong data-start=3D"1116" data-e=
nd=3D"1167">That script is <code data-start=3D"1133" data-end=3D"1164">crea=
te_competition_circuit.py</code>.</strong></p>
<p data-start=3D"1169" data-end=3D"1251">It=E2=80=99s basically an <em data=
-start=3D"1187" data-end=3D"1207">internal generator</em> the team used whe=
n preparing competition 1.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1253" data-end=3D"1256">
<h1 data-start=3D"1258" data-end=3D"1279">=F0=9F=A7=A0 <strong data-start=
=3D"1263" data-end=3D"1279">Who uses it?</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"1281" data-end=3D"1328">=E2=9C=94=EF=B8=8F The subnet dev=
elopers (Inference Labs)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1329" data-end=3D"1414">Used to create or refresh the <str=
ong data-start=3D"1359" data-end=3D"1371">baseline</strong> competition cir=
cuit shipped with Subnet-2.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1416" data-end=3D"1442">=E2=9D=8C Not used by miners</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1443" data-end=3D"1475">Miners <strong data-start=3D"1450"=
 data-end=3D"1459">never</strong> need to run it.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1477" data-end=3D"1524">=E2=9D=8C Not required to create =
your own circuit</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1525" data-end=3D"1594">If you are doing <strong data-star=
t=3D"1542" data-end=3D"1552">Path B</strong> (custom SOTA miner), you do th=
is instead:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1596" data-end=3D"1687">
<li data-start=3D"1596" data-end=3D"1611">
<p data-start=3D"1598" data-end=3D"1611">Train model</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1612" data-end=3D"1627">
<p data-start=3D"1614" data-end=3D"1627">Export ONNX</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1628" data-end=3D"1648">
<p data-start=3D"1630" data-end=3D"1648">Run ezkl compile</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1649" data-end=3D"1678">
<p data-start=3D"1651" data-end=3D"1678">Upload via CircuitManager</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1679" data-end=3D"1687">
<p data-start=3D"1681" data-end=3D"1687">Done</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1689" data-end=3D"1733">No need for <code data-start=3D"17=
01" data-end=3D"1732">create_competition_circuit.py</code>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1735" data-end=3D"1738">
<h1 data-start=3D"1740" data-end=3D"1785">=F0=9F=9B=A0=EF=B8=8F <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1746" data-end=3D"1785">What does the script do internally?</str=
ong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"1787" data-end=3D"1815">Here=E2=80=99s the typical workflo=
w:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1817" data-end=3D"2278">
<li data-start=3D"1817" data-end=3D"1848">
<p data-start=3D"1820" data-end=3D"1848">Load a specified ONNX file</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"1892">
<p data-start=3D"1852" data-end=3D"1892">Generate ezkl =E2=80=9Csettings=E2=
